gl.js is miniquad's own loader, taken verbatim from the crate source
(miniquad-0.4.11/js/gl.js) and vendored here on purpose.

It is not published to npm and not shipped in this repository by cargo, so it has to
travel with the page. Its version is checked at load time against the `crate_version`
the module exports, and a mismatch is a console error rather than a crash — which is
exactly the kind of failure nobody notices. macroquad 0.4.16 pins miniquad to =0.4.11,
so the pairing is stable; if that pin ever moves, this file must be refreshed with it.

